So we would have 0.087 which is our Ka value times the gamma of the soil being 120 pounds per cubic foot.

00:10:32.059 --> 00:10:40.059
And then the depth of Z of the soil which we have as 7 feet squared.

00:10:40.059 --> 00:10:52.059
We're in this equation up here all over 2 and that should calculate out to be the same number here.

00:10:52.059 --> 00:10:57.059
So if I do this in my calculator very quickly.

