So that would have been how you calculate Pa and from there if you wanted your your moments you just would have had to work backwards from what we did here.

00:11:15.059 --> 00:11:26.059
And they'd asked for maybe the factor of safety instead you could have still used this to get the calculation of the moment for the wall.

00:11:26.059 --> 00:11:34.059
You would have had the calculation of the moment in the soil and you could have calculated for your factor of safety that way.

